                        "entry_id": "5330385e-2d03-3aa4-ac37-bc0c05124534",
                        "glosses": [
                            "female equivalent of пассажи́р (passažír): female passenger"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine",
                            "form-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "325fbd6b-7c62-41bb-8795-fb01cd05efe5",
                                "sense_id": "70d5781b-f0e4-3f47-a967-b740135a69a1",
                                "text": "В купе́ пе́рвого кла́сса сиде́ла пассажи́рка — на́до полага́ть, та са́мая, кото́рой железнодоро́жная инстру́кция не дозво́лила путеше́ствовать в одино́честве.",
                                "translation": "There was a lady passenger sitting in the first-class compartment – presumably the one who had been prevented from travelling in solitude by the rules of the railway.",
                                "english": "There was a lady passenger sitting in the first-class compartment – presumably the one who had been prevented from travelling in solitude by the rules of the railway."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
